  "content": {
    "en": "Looseleaf is a hand-drawn React and Tailwind CSS v4 component library and shadcn registry where every surface is rendered as paper and every outline is drawn with an ink pen. Built on top of Radix primitives and Kevin Sans typography, it preserves shadcn/ui props and data slots while using deterministic SVG ink recipes to draw organic borders, paper cards, stickers, stamps, and doodles with fully accessible keyboard and screen-reader support.",
    "zh": "Looseleaf 是一套具有纯手绘纸实质感的 React 与 Tailwind CSS v4 组件库及 shadcn 注册表。项目基于 Radix 原语与手绘字体 Kevin Sans 构建，完整保持了 shadcn/ui 的组件结构、属性与 data-slot 规范。其底层通过确定性随机种子的 SVG 墨水配方绘制生动的毛边笔触、纸张卡片、贴纸印章与手绘图标，在呈现温暖速写美学的同时，兼具完整的无障碍支持与即拷即用的工程体验。"
  },
